#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059768 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059577 :question/id #uuid "b5967dd6-bdf9-5cd0-9639-ec2816d04256" :question/math-academy-id "e-4684" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y+x-5-3z &=0 \\\\ z &=y+7x \\\\ y+3-2z &=1-2x\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+y-3z &=5 \\\\ -7x-y+z &=0 \\\\ 2x+y-2z &=-2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}\n\t\t1 & 1 & -3  \\\\\n\t\t-7 & -1 & 1  \\\\\n                2 & 1 & -2 \n\t\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & -3 & 5 \\\\ -7 & -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2 & -2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3f9ccaa5-d69c-584d-946e-0c57b3050160" :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186671427 :question-generator/id #uuid "5c0964d7-976a-5b36-b5f4-cf8d72e15541" :question-generator/script "generators/f0/f0e2dd207a0a1547483eda91cf35373acca52b121645d2a5be8d2e9dd1427e67/17592186059768.py"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059969 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0f36c6d0-d4a6-5f4b-8a3b-e70b9d746666" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 9\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238184} {:answer/id #uuid "5b0b792e-91b6-5398-8f05-b6eca06d89b7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1 & 9\\end{array}\\ri