alue "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}8 & 19 & -1 & 6 \\\\ -17 & 21 & 0 & -23 \\\\ 15 & -1 & -19 & 0\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510648} :answer-field/id #uuid "3ac74c0e-650c-5c0d-aae4-91abf12af746" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510644}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "714ef0d8-896f-59ee-b57c-671f5e95cb44" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}8x+19y-z &=6 \\\\ 23-17x &=-21y \\\\ -y+15x &=19z\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}8x+19y-z &=6 \\\\ -17x+21y+0z &=-23 \\\\ 15x-y-19z &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 19 & -1 \\\\ -17 & 21 & 0 \\\\ 15 & -1 & -19\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}8 & 19 & -1 & 6 \\\\ -17 & 21 & 0 & -23 \\\\ 15 & -1 & -19 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186510670 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1badd14a-eaf0-58c4-a328-dd88ca238646" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}23 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510637} {:answer/id #uuid "2c8050c5-a8f1-55cb-bf44-7edb50ce94da" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}23 & 1 & 1 & 8 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 19\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510640} {:answer/id #uuid "33d9bf36-b2d4-51a8-a05d-6abb84fcba7c" :answer/type {:db/ide