 :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "ddb271f2-8b6c-582a-be41-92204467bbdd" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}1-x &=14y \\\\ y-15 &=18x\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-x-14y &=-1 \\\\ -18x+y &=15\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -14 \\\\ -18 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & -14 & -1 \\\\ -18 & 1 & 15\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186671426 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0d0a3723-e177-55a5-a4c0-2dc9242c5fcc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & 22 & -1 \\\\ 13 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671392} {:answer/id #uuid "556a8753-c016-5a8d-9d3b-486663fe380b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}22 & -1 & 13 \\\\ -1 & -1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671402} {:answer/id #uuid "9c08187b-6d3e-5536-975b-7575be941487" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -1 & 13 \\\\ -1 & -1 & 22\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671409} {:answer/id #uuid "a65037b0-0ba1-5249-89d6-95f1eccaa4eb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}13 & 22 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671412} {:answer/id #uuid "e693eeac-6aa4-55b5-a6d6-6e0f5dbb2697" :answer/type {:db/i